Thaumcraft 2 Tribute Port - licensing

This repository contains material under different terms.

1. Original Thaumcraft 2 material

   Thaumcraft 2 and its original code, artwork, sounds and text are by Azanor
   and remain his property (All Rights Reserved). This port reuses that
   material to bring Thaumcraft 2.1.6d to Minecraft 26.1.2 as a non-commercial
   tribute. Nothing in this repository grants any licence to the original
   Thaumcraft material, and the GPL below does not apply to it.

2. Port code and new material

   Everything written for this port that is not original Thaumcraft 2
   material - including the addon API, the loader integration, the build
   scripts, the documentation, the examples and Alt's patches - is
   Copyright (C) Alt and the port's contributors, and is licensed under the
   GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later
   version. The full text is in COPYING.

   This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but
   WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY
   or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for
   more details.

3. MultiLoader Template

   The build is based on the MultiLoader Template by Jaredlll08, released
   under CC0. Its notice is preserved in LICENSE-MultiLoader.

Minecraft, Fabric and NeoForge are separate projects with their own terms.
This project is unofficial and is not endorsed by Azanor, Mojang, Microsoft,
